{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1540556-evocation-suggestions","id":1540556,"title":"Evocation suggestions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-17T02:35:11-07:00","id":1540556,"title":"Evocation suggestions","content":"I'm joining an Exalted Essence game and was just looking for some suggestions regarding Evocations for an artifact.<br /> <br /> I'm playing a Night caste but rather than the typical Assassin I was picturing the character more like a relentless slasher-type horror movie monster character. That's a bit more in the Abyssal wheelhouse, so I picked up a set of soulsteel heavy plate for the character. <br /> <br /> I was hoping to get some ideas for 3 Evocations. Conceptual space is being supernaturally tough and being brutally relentless in chasing down a target.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-17T22:45:27-07:00","id":1540609,"title":"","content":"I can't help with the mechanical side, but just ideas from the slasher villain side then something that lets you burn your anima for a short to medium range teleport. Or you can use that as the flavor and have it apply a penalty to enemies defenses. Attack evocation that allows you to add your enemies wound penalties to their onslaught penalty (not sure on the refresh mechanic to not make that potentially horrific in short order) or that one brawl charm from the core that keeps onslaught from resetting so long as you keep attacking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-19T21:32:31-07:00","id":1540749,"title":"","content":"So I haven't looked much at Essence. But I definitely toyed around with the idea of Movie Slasher evocations <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=841315#post841315\">here</a> if it helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-20T21:14:20-07:00","id":1540820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1540556-evocation-suggestions?p=1540609#post1540609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't help with the mechanical side, but just ideas from the slasher villain side then something that lets you burn your anima for a short to medium range teleport. Or you can use that as the flavor and have it apply a penalty to enemies defenses. Attack evocation that allows you to add your enemies wound penalties to their onslaught penalty (not sure on the refresh mechanic to not make that potentially horrific in short order) or that one brawl charm from the core that keeps onslaught from resetting so long as you keep attacking.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't appear that Onslaught Penalties exist in Exalted Essence, but your first idea is good. I might make it so it only works in a shadowy area, or at least not under bright sunlight. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1540556-evocation-suggestions?p=1540749#post1540749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I haven't looked much at Essence. But I definitely toyed around with the idea of Movie Slasher evocations <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=841315#post841315\">here</a> if it helps.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That definitely gives me some ideas to work with. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-21T10:56:18-07:00","id":1540848,"title":"","content":"I wonder if that stalking charm in solar stealth can also work, where you stack more damages for your alpha strike the longer they haven\u2019t found you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}